type: software
title: "Agents on AWS Lab"
abstract: "Lab 8 of an AI Engineering curriculum: Terraform for a private-node EKS cluster with KMS-encrypted secrets and audit logs, IRSA with a least-privilege role trusted by one service account, S3, ECR and Secrets Manager; a hardened Helm chart with probes, autoscaling, disruption budgets, network policy and render-time guards; infrastructure tests with a mocked AWS provider and negative controls; and a kind-cluster deployment in CI gated by the previous lab's eval and promotion gates."
